  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;be a function defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>25</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>25</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup></math>. If the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>25</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>25</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>25</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>25</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>50</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>50</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>50</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
